#: scenario9:scenario9_6E4A8859_8DE0_46C7_ADD1_3C484B066284
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e0e2173ccfea7bfdf7eda201700864bcbcf9663e86b8b25105a05e6230edb4a
